epigenetic modifications in tumorigenesis."}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2036, "end": 2206, "text": "Her research was met with acclaim, earning her several publications in prestigious scientific journals, including the Journal of Biological Chemistry and Cancer Research."}, "D2S20": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2207, "end": 2250, "text": "Chapter 4: Collaborations and Breakthroughs"}, "D2S21": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2252, "end": 2410, "text": "Monica's work at the institute was characterized by a spirit of collaboration, as she worked closely with colleagues from diverse backgrounds and disciplines."}, "D2S22": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2411, "end": 2443, "text": "One such collaboration, with Dr."}, "D2S23": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2444, "end": 2590, "text": "Juan Carlos Izpisúa Belmonte, a pioneer in the field of regenerative medicine, led to a groundbreaking discovery in the area of stem cell biology."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Monica Fallon", "scope": "work for", "claim": "Monica Fallon worked for the Institute of Biomedical Research of Barcelona.", "answer": "Institute of Biomedical Research of Barcelona", "quote": "In 2005, Monica's academic trajectory took a significant turn when she joined the Institute of Biomedical Research of Barcelona as a postdoctoral researcher.", "original_document_number": 2}], "current_answers": ["Cardiff University", "Institute of Biomedical Research of Barcelona"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "Cardiff University", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "Institute of Biomedical Research of Barcelona", "origin": "initial"}]}
